{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/6pcy6gdwc4lo2xatxlp6lnarhthmp3m.mp3","text":"有事快说，有屁快放，姑奶奶忙得很，没多少时间应付你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/7k7z3zzjml2hmf30buxj4q0zwmegpfa.mp3","text":"呀！......混账东西，谁允许你碰我的尾巴的，小心我把你扇飞！还有，忘掉我刚才的声音，忘不掉我可以帮你物理遗忘。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/rttr0imwaqhumscbs5w2etpag71hhke.mp3","text":"我这块门板？看也知道吧，我自己做的，多功能。建议你别乱碰，会出人命的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/owrzren4nop6m8aqkiiulfo1t4xhnek.mp3","text":"不得不说，罗德岛反正也要到处跑，我跟着你们的轨迹四处探险好像比我自己走路要快点，嗯，不错，稍微对你们改观了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/qn2wub0pwsq2td49lyae9227wwsj9u2.mp3","text":"别把我和麦哲伦相提并论，我可不是什么探险家，我只是为了追求刺激才在这片大地上到处跑的。为后人开辟道路？姑奶奶可没那么高尚。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/4jlyv7pm33k6z36pruuk3977vdwoof3.mp3","text":"越是危险我越要去，越是疯狂我越享受，要是不这样，那人生又有什么意思。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/8wu1413flk5neaitvov39ql5wr25qeb.mp3","text":"麦哲伦？我跟这个自来熟的小丫头片子是在黑流树海认识的，那可真是姑奶奶有生以来最吵闹的一次探险了。不过这丫头确实有点水平，这我承认。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/7hs7epahhyj7pf9z3viif51zt727jli.mp3","text":"朋友？谁要那玩意，姑奶奶的人生目标就是做个混账东西，最好谁也别喜欢我，我也没空去喜欢别人。比起这个，今晚喝一杯？给个准话。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/hh5n8skk0bmmx5qaf0wm319uipvyox5.mp3","text":"我的病？我知道挺严重的，但是只要没给别人添麻烦，怎么对待是我的自由。我的想法很简单，死在旅途上又没什么不好，你要真有本事可以试试到时候把我救回来。加油啊，博士，我不看好你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/3h1kp18llg5bmckwgs36kpx1c07w7vr.mp3","text":"睡着了？很好，让我来制造一点噪音吧，哈哈。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/hldvkuy4ymska57jvt0z7ovc9f3vdpm.mp3","text":"虽然我一年里至少有一半时间在外探险，但工资我要正常待遇，也要给我留一间宿舍，你要这样的员工？......要了？哈？啧，神经。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/4y7w5yjkfc94v10z6uhod0kdyfxeo28.mp3","text":"算了，就当学点防身术......","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/27sujbgk5acaevjn1afdcaf76jgh4xh.mp3","text":"“罗德岛科考队名誉队长”？我？哈？","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/cc2jpn3y5aihskp8ob6rhdzup2a7t74.mp3","text":"我不会给你任何我能为罗德岛做什么的保证，这不是姑奶奶的风格。不过如果你想知道这片大地的未解之谜，那就由我来为你揭开吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/prjlbm9s5d5w50eouzxj2bybmfeqcji.mp3","text":"团队行动？饶了我吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/tp0lbjr2vgd0jpwvvu2e781cvvqrhjk.mp3","text":"啧，博士，你想为难我就直说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/fnrxnzkb118q1wv5z5y22bmy44rodlr.mp3","text":"跟不上就自个找点事做吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/j0pjz3tnxuzim4dthotcottn8k7wuu2.mp3","text":"啧，麻烦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/6sgowrxtzczvr59p5ad9qodt8xov6m7.mp3","text":"是是是。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/dmup1uf0vdoxyb9fps9hkinylu4x10k.mp3","text":"在在在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/49kk0cd9e6idyumyxs3kc7wq116y691.mp3","text":"好好好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/1crx0lamrzxnvipliy3h41bqspii1yw.mp3","text":"行行行。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/l471ayh56zq61eqhmalc1n6l50nap7c.mp3","text":"吃屎去吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/miorr2nxhsxtl63yyqv82xqezu8t0j7.mp3","text":"赏你们一门板。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/irhguartu128wwvmm0uuhvgszu3sc3f.mp3","text":"啊，好无聊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/61/idx93hanrdojtkwkdbz177jd0du4ltf.mp3","text":"怎么没完没了的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/4ohuzdjq7aie24y19wsdhr1ntclrf8k.mp3","text":"姑奶奶见惯了大风大浪，这点程度还不算什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/6778axy8cnp8fbrp4mozcagsnb5exur.mp3","text":"唉，没劲，我去附近逛逛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/i63v8pq50l1smo1k68j42w0t0qurbbk.mp3","text":"差不多得了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/97hbzk3emoqfk3osgrmqlykj12msvxq.mp3","text":"啧......难道现在我必须安慰一下这家伙吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/8208jsl1lsvbsnc5ujmlycnkm8uc77z.mp3","text":"该回宿舍睡觉了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/1lw1l0kbg8djw99i7nlqlimnwgftviv.mp3","text":"嗯？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/carqfq88n7bhyctzejh6aexvm9s9pnn.mp3","text":"对了，要先去趟博士的办公室......","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/t15xfs8mst7kdg4hk7zd2caoeo63ty4.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/faedaw449de0x6ic95xtc5mnyk5l3i9.mp3","text":"要命，忘了今天是新年了，不该这时候回来的，姑奶奶最烦这种一大群人聚在一起......啧，之前在萨尔贡遇到的那群阿达克利斯人都没你们能闹。还拉着我干什么？手放开！我要回房！","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/m0mko443hs9014vmjkbf8fu8ciac8sw.mp3","text":"你很闲吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_378_asbest/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/srm7hah2d8y6eanvb8cakafqz4cg63j.mp3","text":"有事快说，有屁快放，姑奶奶忙得很，没多少时间应付你。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/4fervpc0qw9ufvkxve9tnnm6ozv6crb.mp3","text":"呀！......混账东西，谁允许你碰我的尾巴的，小心我把你扇飞！还有，忘掉我刚才的声音，忘不掉我可以帮你物理遗忘。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/12/926p1ksai41kf66bbgva5tgz4u8cwed.mp3","text":"我这块门板？看也知道吧，我自己做的，多功能。建议你别乱碰，会出人命的。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/aiaae54tvzgy1u5kvehzg6p4f5ruuqu.mp3","text":"不得不说，罗德岛反正也要到处跑，我跟着你们的轨迹四处探险好像比我自己走路要快点，嗯，不错，稍微对你们改观了。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/5246ud9mxt4365skjegy76z0hy7ysod.mp3","text":"别把我和麦哲伦相提并论，我可不是什么探险家，我只是为了追求刺激才在这片大地上到处跑的。为后人开辟道路？姑奶奶可没那么高尚。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/83gcmlc4l449t9svpo3ks67kbpykeh7.mp3","text":"越是危险我越要去，越是疯狂我越享受，要是不这样，那人生又有什么意思。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/m11yj6y72mxvd7rc9cyv2u01t61q7uz.mp3","text":"麦哲伦？我跟这个自来熟的小丫头片子是在黑流树海认识的，那可真是姑奶奶有生以来最吵闹的一次探险了。不过这丫头确实有点水平，这我承认。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/hgcdlldqohkjfepgkmg44cdcvyjny62.mp3","text":"朋友？谁要那玩意，姑奶奶的人生目标就是做个混账东西，最好谁也别喜欢我，我也没空去喜欢别人。比起这个，今晚喝一杯？给个准话。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/mszawke217ldm1cut2dtpi7shcl1vhk.mp3","text":"我的病？我知道挺严重的，但是只要没给别人添麻烦，怎么对待是我的自由。我的想法很简单，死在旅途上又没什么不好，你要真有本事可以试试到时候把我救回来。加油啊，博士，我不看好你。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/bm4mlkkkk7in9cp11kiiqem8pde4zs0.mp3","text":"睡着了？很好，让我来制造一点噪音吧，哈哈。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/5010wj8nr83pdyazf8c6qi708qe9dqa.mp3","text":"虽然我一年里至少有一半时间在外探险，但工资我要正常待遇，也要给我留一间宿舍，你要这样的员工？......要了？哈？啧，神经。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/m26w8k36c8dcz09vgkgkob4kq5ubrq1.mp3","text":"算了，就当学点防身术......","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/n8ys1bkgwydxmp4pxk6ldl3pwmv4v4b.mp3","text":"“罗德岛科考队名誉队长”？我？哈？","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/idetgk553l8bhd06y22avidr4tue73t.mp3","text":"我不会给你任何我能为罗德岛做什么的保证，这不是姑奶奶的风格。不过如果你想知道这片大地的未解之谜，那就由我来为你揭开吧！","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/db5cpzsi29k4me6ncxl8hqidqqsoqgs.mp3","text":"团队行动？饶了我吧......","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/o3izz9u2qde360gfuj6h58kk9voyw34.mp3","text":"啧，博士，你想为难我就直说。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/06nd8q23mi42213nxfgndtifahc2vb1.mp3","text":"跟不上就自个找点事做吧。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/2lkzcsw0ruxpwr2p5b5atdj7jf882xr.mp3","text":"啧，麻烦。","alt":"voice/char_378_asbest/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/fpmvtcae21b7iopaxck5yulxp2rxs1c.mp3","text":"是是是。","alt":"voice/char_378_asb